your character with fun hats, unlockable outfits, and expressive gear. Whether you want to look cool, silly, or just different \u2014 it\u2019s your battlefield look.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you\u2019re excited about intense action, wild builds, and co-op mayhem \u2014 don\u2019t miss out.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add <strong>Last Survivor: Day on Earth</strong> to your wishlist now to stay updated and be the first to jump in at launch!</i></p>",
